 # todo
 
-A small CLI todo manager backed by a JSON file. `python -m todo.cli --file t.json add "x"`.
+A small CLI todo manager backed by SQLite by default (`~/.todo.db`, override with
+`--file` or the `TODO_FILE` env var). JSON storage is still available: any path
+ending in `.json` uses the JSON backend.
+
+```sh
+python -m todo.cli add "x"                 # uses ~/.todo.db
+python -m todo.cli --file t.json add "x"   # JSON backend
+python -m todo.cli rename 1 "new title"
+python -m todo.cli migrate src.json dst.db # or either direction
+```
+
+`migrate SRC DST` copies all tasks between stores (backend chosen by extension),
+preserving ids, done flags, created_at and tags. It fails if the destination is
+not empty.
+
 Tests: `python -m pytest -q`.
